        "summary": "Mandaadi (transl.\u2009Sea Wanderer) is an upcoming Indian Tamil-language sports action drama film written and directed by Mathimaran Pugazhendhi of Selfie (2022) fame and produced by Elred Kumar under the banner of RS Infotainment. The film stars Soori in the titular role, alongside Suhas (in his Tamil film debut) and Mahima Nambiar.\nThe film was officially announced in January 2025 under the tentative title Soori's Next; the official title was announced that April. Filming began in mid-2025 and wrapped in April 2026. The film has music composed by G. V. Prakash Kumar, cinematography handled by S. R. Kathir and editing by Pradeep E. Ragav.\nMandaadi is scheduled to release in theatres on 10 September 2026 in standard, IMAX, EPIQ and Dolby Cinema formats. <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\">\u2018Mandaadi\u2019 trailer: Soori\u2019s intense boat racing drama promises action, rivalry, and emotion</a>\u00a0\u00a0<font color=\"#6f6f6f\">The Times of India</font>\nPublished: Sat, 05 Sep 2026 05:30:00 GMT <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\">10 things to know about Soori\u2019s upcoming Mandaadi</a>\u00a0\u00a0<font color=\"#6f6f6f\">DT Next</font>\nPublished: Sat, 05 Sep 2026 07:56:45 GMT",
